Grapples the target and inflicts [59, 79, 95, 108, 120 (TL1-5; PP 100)] physical damage. If the target is already grappled, the target will be maimed as well, reducing damage by [16, 22, 27, 30, 34 (TL1-5; PP 100)] and global speed by 30% for [3, 4, 5, 6, 7 (TL1-5)] turns.

The grapple effects will be based off your grapple talent, if you have it, and the damage will scale with your Physical Power.
